sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as KServe Ingress<br/>Chain
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>Sidecar
    participant REST as REST Server<br/>(FastAPI/Uvicorn)<br/>8080/TCP
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server<br/>(AsyncIO)<br/>8081/TCP
    participant DP as DataPlane<br/>Handler
    participant Runtime as ML Runtime<br/>(e.g. SKLearn)
    participant Models as Model Repository<br/>(/mnt/models)
    participant MetricsSrv as Metrics Server<br/>8082/TCP
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector

    Note over Client,OTel: Inference Request Flow (REST)
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Bearer Token
    Ingress->>Proxy: Forward request
    Proxy->>Proxy: Validate OpenShift OAuth/<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Proxy->>REST: HTTP/8080 (plaintext)<br/>Auth validated
    REST->>DP: Route to DataPlane handler
    DP->>Runtime: Delegate to model runtime
    Runtime->>Models: Load model artifacts<br/>(if not cached)
    Models-->>Runtime: Model data
    Runtime-->>DP: Prediction result
    DP-->>REST: InferenceResponse
    REST-->>Proxy: JSON Response
    Proxy-->>Ingress: Forward response
    Ingress-->>Client: HTTP 200 + JSON

    Note over Client,OTel: Streaming Inference (REST SSE)
    Client->>Ingress: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer_stream
    Ingress->>Proxy: Forward request
    Proxy->>REST: HTTP/8080
    REST->>DP: Route to DataPlane
    DP->>Runtime: Stream inference
    loop Server-Sent Events
        Runtime-->>REST: Partial result
        REST-->>Client: SSE event
    end

    Note over Client,OTel: Inference Request Flow (gRPC)
    Client->>Ingress: gRPC ModelInfer
    Ingress->>Proxy: Forward request
    Proxy->>GRPC: gRPC/8081 (insecure port)<br/>Auth validated
    GRPC->>DP: Route to DataPlane handler
    DP->>Runtime: Delegate to model runtime
    Runtime-->>DP: Prediction result
    DP-->>GRPC: InferResponse
    GRPC-->>Proxy: gRPC response
    Proxy-->>Ingress: Forward response
    Ingress-->>Client: gRPC response

    Note over Client,OTel: Model Repository Operations
    Client->>Proxy: POST /v2/repository/models/{name}/load
    Proxy->>REST: HTTP/8080
    REST->>DP: Load model request
    DP->>Models: Load from /mnt/models
    Models-->>DP: Model loaded
    DP-->>REST: Success
    REST-->>Client: HTTP 200

    Note over Client,OTel: Observability
    REST->>OTel: Export traces (gRPC)<br/>(health endpoints excluded)
    GRPC->>OTel: Export traces (gRPC)
    MetricsSrv->>MetricsSrv: Prometheus /metrics<br/>port 8082
